      "binding": "specified",
      "rule": "Openings are grouped rather than evenly distributed: a large arched opening, a band of three or five smaller openings under a single relieving arch or lintel, and long stretches of blank wall. The rhythm is A-BBB-A, not A-A-A-A.",
